<title>USA: Borders to open Richfield, Minn., store.</title>
<headline>Borders to open Richfield, Minn., store.</headline>
<dateline>RICHFIELD, Minn. 1997-01-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Borders Group Inc said Tuesday it signed a lease to open a 25,449-square-foot bookstore in Richfield, Minnesota, this spring.</p>
<p>The new Borders Books Music &amp; Cafe will create more than 50 jobs and become the company's third store in Minnesota, Borders Group said.</p>
<p>Based in Ann Arbor, Michigan, Borders Group operates a chain of 900 bookstores nationwide.</p>
<p>Its shares were trading up 1/4 Tuesday afternoon at 34-7/8.</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
</text>
